<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Ramanujan returns two days after his first visit. He had the abdominal ultrasound yesterday morning and gave the second and third induced sputum samples yesterday and this morning, staying in his room in between as asked. He still has evening fevers, last night to 38.4 °C, with sweats, and the dull ache under his right ribs, worse when he breathes in deeply. He is eating little and taking acetaminophen. He has had no diarrhea for several years. He has read about tuberculosis and is frightened of it. He met Dr. Raghunathan of infectious diseases here today. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fever</td><td>Evening fevers to 38.4 °C with sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Pain</td><td>Dull right upper quadrant ache, worse on deep breathing</td></tr><tr><td>Tests since intake</td><td>Ultrasound yesterday; sputum samples two and three</td></tr><tr><td>Concern</td><td>Afraid he has tuberculosis</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
